<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">Ref No: {{{Case.Case_Number__c}}}<br />
<br />
Hi {{{Case.First_Name__c}}},<br />
<br />
Thank you for reaching out to to the Qantas Customer Care team.
<p>I was sorry to hear about your experience &nbsp;{{{Case.Flight_Number__c}}}.<br />
<br />
We know the ability to board via our priority boarding lane is important to our most loyal customers and apologise for the impact this had on your journey.<br />
<br />
<strong><em>If not available at departure port, add:</em></strong><br />
<br />
<strong>Our premium boarding lanes</strong><br />
We provide premium boarding lanes in Brisbane, Melbourne, Perth, Canberra, Sydney and Adelaide Domestic airports, but don't currently have this facility available in {{{Case.Departure_Airport__c}}}.<br />
<br />
<strong><em>If no pre-boarding for children, use:</em></strong><br />
<br />
<strong>Pre-boarding for children</strong><br />
We understand that parents appreciate pre-boarding so they can get their little ones ready for the flight ahead.<br />
<br />
I appreciate your disappointment in finding out we were unable to provide this prior to {{{Case.Flight_Number__c}}}. We’re happy to provide this service when time permits, however this isn’t always possible.<br />
<br />
<strong>We value your opinion</strong><br />
Customer feedback is extremely important to us so that we can provide you with exceptional service each time you fly with Qantas.<br />
<br />
I want to assure you that I've passed your comments on to the relevant team for review.<br />
&nbsp;<br />
Thank you for taking the time to let us know about your experience and we look forward to welcoming you onboard again soon.</p>
</body>
</html>